{
  "slug": "are-slip-and-fall-injuries-covered-by-insurance",
  "title": "Are Slip and Fall Injuries Covered by Insurance?",
  "excerpt": "Yes, slip and fall injuries in Colorado are often covered by insurance, particularly through homeowners’ or commercial liability policies. When someone is injured because a property owner failed to maintain safe conditions, their insurance, whether it’s homeowners or commercial liability, may help pay for medical care, lost wages, and related costs. At Dormer Harpring, we […]",
  "publishedAt": "2025-08-29T11:59:19",
  "modifiedAt": "2025-08-29T12:04:07",
  "categories": [
    "slip-and-fall"
  ],
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7af",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ac",
          "text": "Yes,",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ad",
          "text": " slip and fall injuries",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ae",
          "text": " in Colorado are often covered by insurance, particularly through homeowners’ or commercial liability policies. When someone is injured because a property owner failed to maintain safe conditions, their insurance, whether it’s homeowners or commercial liability, may help pay for medical care, lost wages, and related costs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7al",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7ah",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ag",
          "text": "At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ai",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "strong",
            "l7ah"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7aj",
          "text": ",",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ak",
          "text": " we understand that insurance companies don’t always prioritize fair compensation, which is why it’s important to approach these cases with clarity and a well-planned strategy.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i7am",
      "src": "./images/2025-08-shutterstock_2577263351.jpg",
      "alt": "A man falls down"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7ao",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7an",
          "text": "When Is a Homeowner Liable for Slip and Fall Injuries?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7at",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7aq",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-slip-and-fall-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ap",
          "text": "Homeowners in Colorado can be liable for slip-and-fall accidents if the injured person was lawfully on the property and the homeowner didn’t take reasonable steps to prevent harm, such as removing snow, fixing broken stairs, or posting clear warnings. If a slip-and-fall happens at someone’s home, the homeowner’s insurance is usually the first to respond, especially if the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ar",
          "text": "slip-and-fall injuries",
          "marks": [
            "l7aq",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7as",
          "text": " stemmed from unsafe conditions the owner failed to fix or warn about.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7ay",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7av",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.coloradojudicial.gov/sites/default/files/2024-06/Chapter%2012.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7au",
          "text": "As noted in the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7aw",
          "text": "Colorado Jury Instructions – Civil",
          "marks": [
            "l7av"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ax",
          "text": ", a homeowner may be found negligent if they fail to use reasonable care in managing or maintaining their premises, conducting business or activities on the property, or failing to remove, correct, or warn about dangerous conditions. Liability also requires that the plaintiff suffered injuries, damages, or losses as a result of the negligence.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7b0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7az",
          "text": "Negligence isn’t always apparent; it could involve something as straightforward as a cracked driveway or icy sidewalk. For example, a guest slipping on unshoveled steps could create the basis for a valid claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7b2",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7b1",
          "text": "Does Homeowners Insurance Cover a Slip and Fall Injury?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7b7",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7b4",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/most-common-slip-and-fall-injuries-symptoms/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7b3",
          "text": "Yes, homeowners insurance can cover ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7b5",
          "text": "slip and fall injuries",
          "marks": [
            "l7b4",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7b6",
          "text": " if negligence can be shown. These policies often include personal liability coverage, which helps pay for injuries suffered by visitors due to unsafe conditions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l7b9",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://leg.colorado.gov/sites/default/files/r24-815_hoa_and_property_insurance_issue_brief.pdf"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7b8",
          "text": "According to ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ba",
          "text": "Colorado Legislative Council Staff",
          "marks": [
            "l7b9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bb",
          "text": ", individual homeowners in Colorado are not legally required to carry homeowners insurance, though most mortgage lenders require it as a condition for obtaining a loan.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7be",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bd",
          "text": "If a claim is filed, the insurer may investigate whether the homeowner took reasonable action to prevent injury. Claims can be denied if the hazard was open and obvious or if the visitor was trespassing at the time of the accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bg",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bf",
          "text": "When Is a Commercial Liable for Slip and Fall Injuries?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bi",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bh",
          "text": "Commercial properties like stores, offices, and apartment complexes typically carry more safety responsibilities than private homes. Business owners are generally expected to inspect their spaces regularly and address or warn about hazards that might pose a risk to customers or other lawful visitors.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bj",
          "text": "Liability usually applies when staff fail to correct or warn about dangers such as wet floors, icy walkways, or poor lighting. Customers are generally owed a high standard of care, which includes keeping the property in a safe condition and addressing known risks promptly.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bm",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bl",
          "text": "Does Commercial Insurance Cover a Slip and Fall Injury?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bo",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bn",
          "text": "If a slip and fall occurs at a business or retail property, it’s usually the owner’s general liability insurance that handles the cost of the injury. These policies typically cover:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bp",
          "text": "Medical costs",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7br",
          "text": "Lost income",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bt",
          "text": "Legal fees",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7bw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bv",
          "text": "Pain and suffering damages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7by",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bx",
          "text": "The policy typically covers valid claims involving negligence, but insurers may try to limit payouts by arguing that the injured person shares blame or that the business acted reasonably. Since commercial insurers often rely on legal teams and adjusters to challenge claims, strong evidence like video footage or incident reports can be critical to securing fair compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7c0",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7bz",
          "text": "How to Show the Property Owner Was Negligent",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7c2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7c1",
          "text": "To make a successful claim, the injured party must prove that the property owner failed to act reasonably to prevent the slip and fall. This means showing:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7c4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7c3",
          "text": "The owner knew or should have known about the dangerous condition.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7c6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7c5",
          "text": "There was enough time to address or warn about the hazard.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7c8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7c7",
          "text": "No action was taken to correct the issue or warn visitors.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7ca",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7c9",
          "text": "Common examples include a store failing to mop up spilled liquids or a landlord not removing ice from stairs after a snowstorm. Visual evidence and timely medical documentation can strengthen your case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cb",
          "text": "Testimony from witnesses, maintenance logs, and previous complaints can also help demonstrate the owner’s awareness of the hazard. In some cases, expert analysis of lighting conditions or flooring surfaces might be used to show that a fall was preventable.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7ce",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cd",
          "text": "Legal Duties of Property Owners in Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cf",
          "text": "Claims involving injuries on someone else’s property often depend on how the law classifies the visitor. There are typically three main categories:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ch",
          "text": "Invitees",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ci",
          "text": " (customers, tenants): Owed the highest duty of care. Owners must inspect and maintain safe conditions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cm",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ck",
          "text": "Licensees",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cl",
          "text": " (social guests): Owners must warn of known dangers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cn",
          "text": "Trespassers",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7co",
          "text": ": Minimal duty; only to avoid willful or wanton harm.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cq",
          "text": "Invitees",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cr",
          "text": " (customers, tenants): Owed the highest duty of care. Owners must inspect and maintain safe conditions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7ct",
          "text": "Licensees",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cu",
          "text": " (social guests): Owners must warn of known dangers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7cy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cw",
          "text": "Trespassers",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cx",
          "text": ": Minimal duty; only to avoid willful or wanton harm.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7d0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7cz",
          "text": "This legal framework affects how liability is assessed. A store might be held to a higher standard than a private homeowner, particularly if the injured person was there to conduct business.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7d2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7d1",
          "text": "Legal responsibilities may vary depending on the type of visitor; it’s important to understand how the injured person was using the property. That classification affects what the property owner was expected to do and whether those actions were reasonable.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7d4",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7d3",
          "text": "Compensation Available in Slip and Fall Cases",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7d8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7d5",
          "text": "Victims of ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7d6",
          "text": "slip and fall injuries",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7d7",
          "text": " may be eligible for a wide range of financial compensation, depending on the severity of the injury and the specifics of the incident. Compensation can include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7da",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7d9",
          "text": "Hospital bills and ongoing medical treatment",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7dc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7db",
          "text": "Rehabilitation or physical therapy costs",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7de",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7dd",
          "text": "Lost wages from missed work",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7dg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7df",
          "text": "Reduced earning capacity (in long-term injury cases)",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7di",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7dh",
          "text": "Pain and emotional distress",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7dk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7dj",
          "text": "Economic damages like medical bills and lost wages are often straightforward to calculate. In contrast, non-economic damages, such as pain, emotional distress, or long-term impacts like disfigurement, can also factor into a claim’s value. These claims may require medical evaluations or financial assessment, and sometimes face limits depending on the case.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7dm",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7dl",
          "text": "What is the Importance of Legal Advice?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7do",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7dn",
          "text": "Handling a slip-and-fall insurance claim isn’t always straightforward. Property owners and insurers often dispute fault or suggest the injured person shares responsibility, which can affect how much compensation is ultimately recovered.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b7dq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s7dp",
          "text": "Legal guidance makes a huge difference when gathering the right evidence, dealing with insurance obstacles, or presenting a strong case in court. Our team at Dormer Harpring helps clients across Denver understand their rights and options after a fall, working toward fair and full compensation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
